    75→   *                             it doesn't appear in "rowSignature". (It only needs to be accessible via
    76→   *                             {@link RowAdapter#columnFunction}.) As a result, you can achieve an untyped mode by
    77→   *                             passing in {@link RowSignature#empty()}.
    78→   * @param throwParseExceptions whether numeric selectors should throw parse exceptions or use a default/null value
    79→   *                             when their inputs are not actually numeric
    80→   */
    81→  public static <RowType> RowBasedColumnSelectorFactory<RowType> create(
    82→      final RowAdapter<RowType> adapter,
    83→      final Supplier<RowType> supplier,
    84→      final RowSignature signature,
    85→      final boolean throwParseExceptions
    86→  )
    87→  {
    88→    return new RowBasedColumnSelectorFactory<>(supplier, adapter, signature, throwParseExceptions);
    89→  }
